@hostname = localhost
@port = 5000
@host = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}

### ===========================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & TOKEN ACQUISITION (Day 10 Deliverable)
### ===========================================================================

### 1a. Login as Admin (Role: Admin)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@enterprise.io",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 1b. Login as Manager (Role: Manager)
# @name loginManager
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@enterprise.io",
  "password": "Manager123!"
}

### 1c. Login as Employee (Role: Employee)
# @name loginEmployee
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@enterprise.io",
  "password": "Employee123!"
}

### Save Token Variables for subsequent requests
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
@managerToken = {{loginManager.response.body.token}}
@employeeToken = {{loginEmployee.response.body.token}}

### ===========================================================================
### 2. PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (200 OK)
### ===========================================================================

### 2a. Get All Departments & Budgets (EF Core Eager Loading)
GET {{host}}/api/departments
Accept: application/json

### 2b. Get Paginated & Sorted Employees (EF Core Query)
GET {{host}}/api/employees?page=1&pageSize=5&sortBy=salary&desc=true
Accept: application/json

### 2c. Get Top 3 Compensation Earners
GET {{host}}/api/employees/top-earners?count=3
Accept: application/json

### ===========================================================================
### 3. DAY 8: INPUT VALIDATION DEMONSTRATIONS (400 Bad Request ProblemDetails)
### ===========================================================================

### 3a. Invalid Email and Negative Salary Validation
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "J",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "role": "SoftwareEngineer",
  "hireDate": "2024-01-01",
  "baseSalary": -5000,
  "employmentType": "FullTime"
}

### ===========================================================================
### 4. DAY 10: AUTHORIZATION & PERMISSION GATES (200, 201, 204, 401, 403)
### ===========================================================================

### 4a. Create Employee with Admin Token (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Marcus",
  "lastName": "Aurelius",
  "email": "marcus.aurelius@enterprise.io",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "role": "SeniorEngineer",
  "hireDate": "2024-01-15",
  "baseSalary": 125000,
  "employmentType": "FullTime",
  "targetBonusPercentage": 0.15,
  "address": {
    "street": "100 Forum Way",
    "city": "Rome",
    "state": "NY",
    "postalCode": "13440",
    "country": "USA"
  }
}

### 4b. Create Employee WITHOUT Token (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Unauthenticated",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "unauth@enterprise.io",
  "departmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "role": "SoftwareEngineer",
  "hireDate": "2024-01-01",
  "baseSalary": 80000,
  "employmentType": "FullTime"
}

### 4c. Promote Employee as Admin (204 No Content - Permitted)
PATCH {{host}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/promote
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newRole": "StaffEngineer",
  "newSalary": 155000
}

### 4d. Promote Employee as Standard Employee (403 Forbidden - Insufficient Permissions)
PATCH {{host}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/promote
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newRole": "Director",
  "newSalary": 250000
}

### 4e. View Payroll Simulation as Manager (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/employees/payroll-report?companyMultiplier=1.2
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4f. View Payroll Simulation as Employee (403 Forbidden)
GET {{host}}/api/employees/payroll-report?companyMultiplier=1.2
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Accept: application/json
